OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral for officer killed in
OL,4,Acrash to take place
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe funeral of one of the two police
OL,7,Fofficers killed in a wrong-way crash is
OL,8,Fto take place later.
OL,10,FPC Matthew Blades, 37, and PC Tom
OL,11,FClough, 38, died when a Volkswagon
OL,12,FPassat collided with their marked armed
OL,13,Fresponse car on the A66 at South Bank,
OL,14,Fnear Middlesbrough, on 22 August. Five
OL,15,Fyoung men were also killed.
OL,17,FRoad closures will be in place in
OL,18,FHartlepool for PC Blades' funeral from
OL,19,F07:30 BST to allow for a full police
OL,20,Fceremonial funeral.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
